    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dî dia Yehowa diakalua kundi kabidi ne, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muana wa muntu, amba mei a buprofete buebe, amba ne, Mukelenge Yehowa udi wamba ne,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu dituku adi nentume ba-messager, bumuka kundi, benda mu matu, bua kukuatshishabo Bena Atiopa aba badi kabayi ne ntatu buowa; ne kanyinganyinga kakole nekabakuate mu dituku dia kubutuka kua Ejipitu. Bua, monai, dilualua!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu tshidimu tshia dikumi ne tshimue, mu ngondo wa kumudilu, mu dituku dia muanda mutekete dia ngondo, dî dia Yehowa diakalua kundi ne, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muana wa mundi, nakutshibula diboko dia Palô, mukelenge wa Ejipitu; ne tangila, kabena badijingila tshilulu, kabena balabahu buanga bua kudisangasha ne kabena basuikaku tshilulu, bua dikale ne bukole bukumbane bua kukuata muele wa nvita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku Mukelenge Yehowa udi wamba ne, Tangila, ndi ne Palô, mukelenge wa Ejipitu, tshilumbu, nentshibule maboko andi, ne diboko diandi ditshidi ne bukole buadi ne diboko diandi diakutshibuka diambedi, nemponeshe muele wa nvita udi mu tshianza tshiandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nentangadishe Bena Ejipitu munkatshi mua bisamba bia bantu, nembamuangalashe munkatshi mua maloba makuabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nenkoleshe maboko a mukelenge wa Babulona, nenteke muele wa nvita mu bianza biandi, kadi nentshibule maboko a Palô, ne yeye neatue mikemu ku mpala kuandi, mikemu bu ya muntu udi mutahibue mputa ya lufu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nengambule maboko a mukelenge wa Babulona mulu, kadi maboko a Palô nealembelele hanshi; nebamanye ne, Meme ndi Yehowa hanateka muele wanyi wa nvita mu bianza bia mukelenge wa Babulona, ne hawololeye ha buloba bua Ejipitu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 30:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku nentangadishe Bena Ejipitu munkatshi mua bisamba bia bantu, nembamuangalashe munkatshi mua manga maloba; nunku nebamanye ne, Meme ndi Yehowa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.30.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.30.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
